[stdout]     [xslt]          xtrc="p:1;1:418">This image shows the components of the Oracle Globalization Development Kit. The client-tier browser sends requests to the middle-tier application, which sends the requests to the database in the server tier. The database returns a response to the middle-tier application, which sends the response to the browser.</p><p ishlabelxpath="./title | @alt | @href | @conref | self::*[@id and not(@varid)]/@id"
[stdout]     [xslt]          ishlinkxpath="@conref | @href[contains(parent::*/@class,' topic/image ') and not(parent::*/@conref)] | @href[contains(parent::*/@class,' topic/longdescref ') and not(parent::*/@conref)] | @href[contains(parent::*/@class,' topic/longquoteref ') and not(parent::*/@conref)]"
